08009230 <ADIN1110_CS_Select>:
  * @brief  Selects the ADIN1110 chip via CS pin
  * @details Sets the SPI1_CS pin low to enable communication with the ADIN1110.
  * @note    Called before SPI transactions to select the device.
  */
